<title>USA: Datapoint Corp drops telephony unit talks.</title>
<headline>Datapoint Corp drops telephony unit talks.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Datapoint Corp said on Wednesday that it has decided not to pursue further talks with interested parties about the sale of its telephony business.</p>
<p>The company said it will continue to position itself as an integrated system provider of telephonic and data transmission services.</p>
<p>Short and long term prospects can be better maximized by retaining the telephony business, Datapoint said.</p>
</text>
